{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/port-de-la-mer-meraas-developer-port-de-la-mer","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":291,"crm_id":"2438","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Port De La Mer","slug":"port-de-la-mer-meraas-developer-port-de-la-mer","display_address":"Port De La Mer","building_type":["penthouse","apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Meraas","price":33000000,"display_price":"33M","lattitude":25.2406449,"longitude":55.2499668,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Port De La Mer is a residential development by Meraas Properties, located on the La Mer Peninsula in the prestigious Jumeirah1 neighborhood of Dubai. The Port De La Mer development's collection of homes comes in the form of five residential communities: La Voile, La Rive, Le Pont, La Cote and Sur La Mer. The complex is presented in a Mediterranean style and has an exclusive collection of properties. It features <strong>1-4 bedroom apartments and 5-bedroom penthouses.</strong> The residences offer views of the bay and the dynamic city skyline. The interiors of the apartments are designed in a modern minimalist style, in light and neutral colors. The layout of each living space provides a balcony, built-in closet, equipped kitchen and bathroom.</p><p>The infrastructure of the complex offers residents the most modern amenities and services: marina, private beach, equipped promenade, landscaped areas for walking and recreation, catering for all tastes, stores and pharmacies, children's outdoor areas, public swimming pools, fitness room and spa center, bank branch and ATMs, parking, controlled entry to the territory.</p><p>Port De La Mer is located in the developed central area of Dubai, where there are many medical and educational institutions. Jumeirah Street, the closest to the complex, connects the peninsula and the main beaches of Dubai with the rest of the city.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/B1mWffqXe280wS7BE6KLwCT355u0yAl125rrawr5.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/B1mWffqXe280wS7BE6KLwCT355u0yAl125rrawr5.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/SY2QeilMFNQCdqZVk3pa79hrQRkhslOKptfWqw7r.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/SY2QeilMFNQCdqZVk3pa79hrQRkhslOKptfWqw7r.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/sMhFcwN8ECbRXNUbLFWZ2wl7gC609PObZMjuHmtZ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/sMhFcwN8ECbRXNUbLFWZ2wl7gC609PObZMjuHmtZ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/0wj253zphhtSV0y8N9l1HHbq3R1ytA2PCqAJFerw.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/0wj253zphhtSV0y8N9l1HHbq3R1ytA2PCqAJFerw.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/mfTeLrQmlq0RijxmUpHSzOrUURWJqDBk1oPkfaRh.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/mfTeLrQmlq0RijxmUpHSzOrUURWJqDBk1oPkfaRh.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/Q5P3IUpNTmwRpC39pt8mFqbyNVpS4II7bZSDfnTt.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/Q5P3IUpNTmwRpC39pt8mFqbyNVpS4II7bZSDfnTt.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/uVJgGKcPi2PwW6nNYkRpafvyhfKRnRsTg8jSegux.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/06/uVJgGKcPi2PwW6nNYkRpafvyhfKRnRsTg8jSegux.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/243